31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anyone have a scary dream?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,A dream is irrelevant. What matters is if the Seer found something.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I did. Rin, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. Mizuki, are you certain about your role?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A direct claim on turn one. Either Mizuki is the Seer, or she's a very bold wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! No way! Mizuki-san, you're lying! I'm just a kid!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Being a child doesn't preclude one from being a wolf, Rin.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I don't lie about these things. The result was clear.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Mizuki is the Seer, the game is almost over. If she's the wolf, she's trying to rush a vote.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your reaction is a bit too loud. It's a classic deflection.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not deflecting! I'm surprised! Mizuki-san is the mean one!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,The logic favors Mizuki. A werewolf claiming Seer usually targets someone less likely to cause a scene.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I have no reason to lie. I suggest we vote for Rin now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I'm inclined to trust Mizuki's composure.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll go with the flow. Mizuki seems too calm to be bluffing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,No! Please believe me! I'm a villager!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pity, but the evidence provided by the Seer is too strong.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's end this.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
